{"reviews":[{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-0","r":5.0,"t":"beautiful ...very surprised at the quality","x":"Bride to be writing this review. I was very shocked at the quality for a set that runs around 9 dollars . not plastic , good weight , just enough bling and very elegant ...I changed my mind and I am wearing this set with my wedding dress . BIG BANG FOR YOUR DOLLARS ON THIS SET .","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-1","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Beautiful, I wore this for my daughters wedding. Very elegant","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-2","r":5.0,"t":"I love that this product is so affordable yet so sophisticated","x":"I love that this product is so affordable yet so sophisticated. I really enjoyed that it came as a set and it is just enough to not be over the top but still get a second glance! If you want something to up your vintage go for it!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great for the price.","x":"I only wore the necklace and bracelet and I received lots of compliments on them. The necklace had only accents of stone in them and it was not too showy. I wanted something simple and this was perfect. Did not get any reaction in the skin either.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-4","r":1.0,"t":"Broken bracelet","x":"The bracelet is made of a poor quality, very thin, plastic string, as you can see in the bottom right corner of my photo. It popped and the pieces fell and rolled in every direction. The string couldn\u2019t fit around my thumb. Return, replace, try wearing it again only because it\u2019s beautiful jewelry. Update: Why was this nice jewelry set being sold in the store near me for $1??? Really!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-5","r":4.0,"t":"Costume jewelry","x":"I bought this set of faux pearls to wear to a wedding. I was worried that they would feel/look like plastic but they didn\u2019t. They are pretty and heavier than expected. Drawbacks: the bracelet is meant for someone with a small wrist; the necklace has extra chain to adjust the length, but it broke off.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-6","r":3.0,"t":"It is pretty cheap jewlery but for a pretty cheap price","x":"What you say is exactly what you get. It is pretty cheap jewlery but for a pretty cheap price. Other reviewers stated they looked even better in person but I disagree. I regret buying these but it is my own fault as you get exactly what you put up the money for.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-7","r":2.0,"t":"Not great","x":"Product looks nice, arrived in a decent amount of time, earrings were the nicest part, the bracelet is on a thin stretchy string which is VERY TIGHT and my wrists are small. I'm 5'5\" and 140lbs. The necklace is also on a \"fishing wire\" type of string which broke before I could even get it out of the package. Very upset as I bought this item to wear for maternity pictures and it broke 10mins before we left the house, luckily my MIL had a pearl necklace that I borrowed.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-8","r":3.0,"t":"You get what you pay for","x":"Exactly what I expected for $10.00.  Costume jewelry that looks pretty good if you don't get too close up.  The extender chain fell off as I took the necklace out of the package.  I was able to reattach it with little effort.  I bought this to wear on a cruise because I don't travel with real jewelry.  I think this will be fine.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-9","r":3.0,"t":"Look at pictured, but had to add length chains ...","x":"Look at pictured, but had to add length chains to make slightly longer. Really gives a classy look if that\u2019s what you are looking to do.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-10","r":5.0,"t":"Great purchase!","x":"It was exactly what I ordered for my wedding! Looked beautiful and seemed to be a good quality set!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-11","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Beautiful and pretty. It was a gift I bought for myself for Mother's Day and they look nice.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-12","r":5.0,"t":"Recommend!","x":"The pearls are so gorgeous!!!!!!!!!!! Very fast delivery. I highly recommend these!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-13","r":5.0,"t":"Nice!","x":"Pearls looks great. They don't look &#34;cheap&#34;. Fits nicely.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-14","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"Looks beautiful in person. Can't beat the price either :-)","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-15","r":4.0,"t":"Beautiful Faux Pearls But Be Aware","x":"Loved this faux pearl set. It looks so classy and I get many compliments. Unfortunately, the bracelet is on a thin plastic string which broke today (see 2nd pic) after only 3 months of having this set. Not sure how long the necklace and earrings will last but I'll definitely be buying this set again (I hope the next set lasts a little longer especially because the price is higher now).","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-16","r":4.0,"t":"Beautiful jewelry set!","x":"Purchased 6 of these sets for my bridesmaids, they were gorgeous! The only problem that I had was that one of the sets I received had two different earrings in the set, therefore one of the girls didn\u2019t get to wear earrings since the wedding was a few days from when I received them. In the future I would like to see the company double check their products for defects like this.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-17","r":5.0,"t":"Great for cheap, white faux pearl strand.","x":"I looked all over for white pearls. I could only find cream colored and maybe that\u2019s because real pearls are never white\u2026I\u2019m not sure. But with a blush pink dress, the cream pearls just didn\u2019t look best. I thought these pearls looked nice and hoped it wasn\u2019t obvious to the guests how cheap they really were.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-18","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome product!","x":"This thing is amazing! It's s not constricting at all and you can't even see it because it has no wire! It put everything in the right place and I look fantastic in my new dress.  Best shape wear I've ever purchased!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-19","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing!","x":"We purchased these as an additional gift for the women in our wedding party. The quality is amazing for the price. They are beautiful, tasteful and well constructed. Everyone loved them.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-20","r":5.0,"t":"Gift","x":"Bought for an elderly woman in a nursing home. She loves jewelry and was very happy to dress up on Sundays and wear this set.  The bracelet broke not long after she got it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-21","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful!","x":"These were beautiful for my wedding day. The earings did bother my ears but im also very sensitive to certain jewelry. Other than that, they were exactly what I wanted.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality","x":"Very beautiful set, nicely made.  Beads are nice and large and the jewelry has a nice weight to it so it does not look or feel cheap. Absolutely loved it","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-23","r":5.0,"t":"Bridesmaids loved the high quality!","x":"Ordered these for my bridesmaids. Everyone loved them! They are so cheap but they feel heavy and expensive. Great value and product. Beautiful.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B01A0B9MRU-24","r":1.0,"t":"Arrived broken","x":"Pretty set but unfortunately arrived broken. The necklace is all just a bunch of beads. Now I\u2019ll need to try to fix it or buy a different set.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the set as beautiful, elegant, and looking better in person than expected.","cites":[1,2,3,4,11,12,13,14,15]},{"text":"Many praise the value, noting it looks sophisticated and not cheap for the low price.","cites":[1,3,4,6,11,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the bracelet is very tight or small, and some say the string broke or popped.","cites":[5,6,8]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention the necklace chain or extender broke or fell off.","cites":[6,8,9]},{"text":"A few reviewers feel it is cheap costume jewelry and exactly what you pay for, with some disappointment.","cites":[7,9,10]}]},"qa":[]}